  "memory.md": "# Agent memory: Marcus\n\n> **Fictional persona. Synthetic data.** This is everything the agent is allowed to remember about Marcus. It stores only workout-relevant context: no event titles, locations, contacts, diagnoses or medical records.\n\n## Profile (user-provided)\n- Age range: 35–44\n- Experience: triathlon for 5 years; three half-Ironman finishes (best 5:41)\n- General fitness: well trained; 9–10 hours a week\n- Injury history: none before this report\n- Current health status: reports an ankle injury (user-reported Oct 5: rolled it on a trail run on Sunday; swollen and painful to walk on). No diagnosis is stored.\n- Energy (user-reported): not stated\n\n## Goals\n- Long-term: Lakeshore 70.3 in under 5:30 on Sun Nov 8, 2026\n- Short-term: a 12-mile long run and a 3-hour ride with race-pace efforts by week 11\n\n## Plan position\n- Week 10 of 14 (Build 3). Plan page: \"Marcus: Half-Ironman Build (14 weeks)\"\n\n## Recurring availability (workout-relevant only)\n- Weekdays: office 8:00 am–5:00 pm; trains 5:45–7:00 am, or 6:00 pm on Tuesdays\n- Weekends: long sessions from 7:00 am\n\n## Known preferences\n- Long run on Saturday; long ride or brick on Sunday.\n\n## Past changes made with the agent\n- None.",
